      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: The company works on a technically very high level. The fuel for the melting process is coke. The furnace is a cupola melting furnace. The emissions are abated by post-combustion with energy recuperation. The partition of the total dust emission to the categories of particulate sizes is based on an uncontrolled mineral wool cupola (EPA 1998) which only partly represent this case.</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2000-01-01" endDate="2000-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="true">
        <comment>
